{"_id":"68a736138ec3d8323af14ea6","nodeId":"TG63YRbSKL1F9vlUVF1VY","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# Neo4j\n\nNeo4j is the most widely used graph database. It stores data natively as nodes and relationships and uses Cypher, a declarative query language designed for graph traversal. Neo4j is used for applications where relationship-heavy queries are central, such as recommendation systems and network analysis.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Neo4j Website","url":"https://neo4j.com","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5231"},{"type":"video","title":"Neo4j in 100 Seconds","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T6L9EoBy8Zk","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5232"},{"type":"video","title":"Neo4j Course for Beginners","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_IgbB24scLI","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5233"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/TG63YRbSKL1F9vlUVF1VY.md"}